   "context": "news",
   "english": "Wanderer trader"
  },
  {
   "idx": 40,
   "id": "N|korath_news|word|109|0",
   "path": "data/korath/korath news.txt",
   "line": 109,
   "kind": "NEWS",
   "context": "news",
   "english": "The Kor Efret worlds are littered with [stark, serious] environmental problems. I have seen nothing of this [magnitude, scale] before."
  },
  {
   "idx": 41,
   "id": "N|korath_news|word|110|0",
   "path": "data/korath/korath news.txt",
   "line": 110,
   "kind": "NEWS",
   "context": "news",
   "english": "The Kor Efreti are a very [prideful, honorable] people. I offered a favor to one free of charge, and it seemed insulted."
  },
  {
   "idx": 42,
   "id": "N|korath_news|word|111|0",
   "path": "data/korath/korath news.txt",
   "line": 111,
   "kind": "NEWS",
   "context": "news",
   "english": "This planet must undergo significant [renovation, changes] before progress can be made. It will take a long time for it to be fully [restored, reborn]."
  },
  {
   "idx": 43,
   "id": "N|korath_news|word|112|0",
   "path": "data/korath/korath news.txt",
   "line": 112,
   "kind": "NEWS",
   "context": "news",
   "english": "I [received, accepted] a job from a terminal earlier. The Kor Efreti are indeed putting them to good use."
  },
  {
   "idx": 44,
   "id": "N|korath_news|word|113|0",
   "path": "data/korath/korath news.txt",
   "line": 113,
   "kind": "NEWS",
   "context": "news",
   "english": "It is [disheartening, upsetting] to see how damaged this world is, but I take comfort knowing we will work to [restore, rebirth] it."
  },
